|------|--------|
| Pydantic schema import | ✅ [TechSpecArtifact](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/schemas/tech_spec.py#78-95) loads and `model_json_schema()` generates correctly |
